  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2057,
      "text": "But if you must turn away from [those in need] while hoping to receive bounty from your Lord[26], then say to them words of comfort.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 285,
      "ruku": 242,
      "hizbQuarter": 114,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2058,
      "text": "Do not be too tight-fisted[27], nor too open-handed[28], for you will end up blameworthy and destitute.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 285,
      "ruku": 242,
      "hizbQuarter": 114,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2059,
      "text": "Your Lord extends provision to whom He wills or restricts it[29]. He is All-Aware and All-Seeing of His slaves.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 285,
      "ruku": 242,
      "hizbQuarter": 114,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2060,
      "text": "Do not kill your children for fear of poverty[30], for We provide for them and for you. Indeed, killing them is a great sin.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 285,
      "ruku": 243,
      "hizbQuarter": 114,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2061,
      "text": "Do not go near adultery[31], for it is indeed a shameful act and an evil way.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 285,
      "ruku": 243,
      "hizbQuarter": 114,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2062,
      "text": "Do not kill any soul that Allah has forbidden, except in the course of justice. If anyone is killed wrongfully, We have given his heir authority [of compensation], but he should not exceed the bounds in killing, for he is already supported [by law].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 285,
      "ruku": 243,
      "hizbQuarter": 114,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2063,
      "text": "Do not approach the property of an orphan except with good [intent][32], until he reaches maturity; and fulfill the covenant, for you will certainly be questioned about the covenant.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 285,
      "ruku": 243,
      "hizbQuarter": 114,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2064,
      "text": "Give full measure when you measure, and weigh with accurate scales; that is fair and best in the end[33].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 285,
      "ruku": 243,
      "hizbQuarter": 114,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2065,
      "text": "Do not follow[34] that of which you have no knowledge. Indeed, the hearing, the sight, and the heart, all of them will be called to account.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 285,
      "ruku": 243,
      "hizbQuarter": 114,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2066,
      "text": "Do not walk on the earth arrogantly; you cannot cleave the earth, nor can you reach the mountains in height[35].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 285,
      "ruku": 243,
      "hizbQuarter": 114,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2067,
      "text": "The evil of all these actions is hateful to your Lord.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
